#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "First day check"
msgstr "Jak první den?"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Good luck on your first day.\n"
"\n"
"If the inbox starts screaming, breathe and sort the customer mail first. Call me before midnight, you promised."
msgstr ""
"Hodně štěstí první den.\n"
"\n"
"Až ti začne pošta řvát, dýchej a nejdřív vyřiď maily od zákazníků. Zavolej mi před půlnocí, {g:slíbil|slíbila} jsi to."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json (+4)
#. uses 8
msgid "Teta Vera <vera.kralova@rodina.cz>"
msgstr "Teta Věra <vera.kralova@rodina.cz>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The first night"
msgstr "První noc"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The first night is always quiet. Nobody has been here long enough to bring anything with them.\n"
"\n"
"Read the rest of the mail, plan tomorrow (the builder locks now, that is the licence, not me) and then go to bed. The room behind the office is yours: the door by the key board. The bed is made and the alarm is set for half past six. If the little television only shows the test card, it is late.\n"
"\n"
"If the main trips in the night, the board is in the generator shed and Novotny's number is on the noticeboard. He moans after nine. Let him.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""
"První noc je vždycky klid. Nikdo tu ještě nebyl dost dlouho, aby s sebou něco přivedl.\n"
"\n"
"Přečti si zbytek pošty, naplánuj zítřek (Builder se teď zamkne, to je licence, ne já) a pak jdi spát. Pokojík za kanceláří je tvůj: dveře u tabule s klíči. Postel je povlečená a budík nařízený na půl sedmou. Když malá televize ukazuje už jen monoskop, je pozdě.\n"
"\n"
"Kdyby v noci vyhodilo hlavní jistič, rozvaděč je v kůlně u generátoru a číslo na Novotného visí na nástěnce. Po deváté bručí. Nech ho.\n"
"\n"
"- V."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The radio"
msgstr "Rádio"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Leave the radio in the office playing at night. Your uncle said the guests sleep better when they can hear it from the tents.\n"
"\n"
"I think he meant himself.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""
"V noci nech v kanceláři hrát rádio. Strýc říkal, že hosté líp spí, když ho slyší až do stanů.\n"
"\n"
"Myslím, že mluvil o sobě.\n"
"\n"
"- V."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:187
#. uses 2
msgid "CampGrid Energy <billing@campgrid.local>"
msgstr "CampGrid Energy <billing@campgrid.local>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tariff reminder"
msgstr "Připomínka tarifu"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Your account is billed nightly at 20:00 local.\n"
"\n"
"Unpaid invoices carry a three day grace period. After that the supply is interrupted and the backup unit in the office will hold the site for approximately six minutes.\n"
"\n"
"This message is automated."
msgstr ""
"Váš účet je vyúčtováván každý den ve 20:00 místního času.\n"
"\n"
"Na úhradu faktury máte lhůtu tři dny. Poté bude dodávka přerušena a záložní zdroj v kanceláři udrží areál v provozu přibližně šest minut.\n"
"\n"
"Tato zpráva byla vytvořena automaticky."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:192
#. uses 2
msgid "CampNet Ops <ops@campnet.local>"
msgstr "CampNet Ops <ops@campnet.local>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Occupancy scan"
msgstr "Kontrola obsazenosti"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Automated report:\n"
"- Mail feed active\n"
"- Occupancy scan complete\n"
"- 1 occupied unit without an assigned guest ID\n"
"\n"
"Ticket closed automatically. No action required."
msgstr ""
"Automatické hlášení:\n"
"- Příjem pošty aktivní\n"
"- Kontrola obsazenosti dokončena\n"
"- 1 obsazená jednotka bez přiděleného ID hosta\n"
"\n"
"Požadavek automaticky uzavřen. Není nutný žádný zásah."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Photo from town"
msgstr "Fotka z města"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"I walked past the old bus stop. It looks exactly like the wallpaper on your camp computer. Same bench, same sign.\n"
"\n"
"Who took that photo?"
msgstr ""
"Šla jsem kolem staré zastávky. Vypadá úplně jako tapeta na tvým počítači v kempu. Stejná lavička, stejná cedule.\n"
"\n"
"Kdo tu fotku dělal?"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Water meter note"
msgstr "Vodoměr"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Quick note: the old water meter drifts at night. If guests complain, tell them we are scheduling service.\n"
"\n"
"It drifted all winter, with the camp shut and nobody here to use a drop. Nobody is scheduling anything."
msgstr ""
"Jen rychle: starý vodoměr se v noci točí. Kdyby si hosté stěžovali, řekni jim, že objednáváme servis.\n"
"\n"
"Točil se celou zimu, když byl kemp zavřený a nebyl tu nikdo, kdo by spotřeboval jedinou kapku. Nikdo nic neobjednává."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "unknown_sender <void@null.invalid>"
msgstr "unknown_sender <void@null.invalid>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "count them"
msgstr "spočítej je"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"you counted them at check-in\n"
"\n"
"count them again after 22:00\n"
"\n"
"the number is not the same"
msgstr ""
"při příjezdu jsi je {g:spočítal|spočítala}\n"
"\n"
"spočítej je znovu po 22:00\n"
"\n"
"nebude to stejné číslo"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Reception <camp.reception@camp.local>"
msgstr "Recepce <camp.reception@camp.local>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/ui/debug_menu.gd:18
#. uses 2
msgid "Night log"
msgstr "Noční deník"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"02:58  gate closed\n"
"03:00  all guests accounted for\n"
"03:01  operator asleep at desk\n"
"\n"
"No incidents."
msgstr ""
"02:58  brána zavřena\n"
"03:00  všichni hosté na místě\n"
"03:01  obsluha spí u stolu\n"
"\n"
"Bez událostí."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "District Office Hlubocany <registr@okres-hlubocany.cz>"
msgstr "Okresní úřad Hlubočany <registr@okres-hlubocany.cz>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Kemp Cerne jezero: inspection of operation"
msgstr "Kemp Černé jezero: kontrola provozu"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Dear operator,\n"
"\n"
"We confirm that the inspection of the operation of the facility Kemp Cerne jezero (parcel 412/3) will take place on Monday 19 October 1998 at 8:00.\n"
"\n"
"The application of Agrostroj Hlubocany a.s. for a change of land use remains with the District Office. Should the facility not be in operation on the date of inspection, the Office will recommend the change.\n"
"\n"
"This letter is for your information. No reply is required.\n"
"\n"
"Ing. Pokorny\n"
"Department of Land Use"
msgstr ""
"Vážený provozovateli,\n"
"\n"
"potvrzujeme, že kontrola provozu zařízení Kemp Černé jezero (parc. č. 412/3) proběhne v pondělí 19. října 1998 v 8:00.\n"
"\n"
"Žádost společnosti Agrostroj Hlubočany a.s. o změnu využití pozemků zůstává u okresního úřadu. Nebude-li zařízení v den kontroly v provozu, úřad změnu doporučí.\n"
"\n"
"Tento dopis je pro Vaši informaci. Odpověď se nevyžaduje.\n"
"\n"
"Ing. Pokorný\n"
"odbor územního plánování"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Socks"
msgstr "Ponožky"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"You were up late again. The grey socks are in the second drawer, the office floor is cold in the morning.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""
"Zase jsi {g:byl|byla} dlouho vzhůru. Šedé ponožky jsou ve druhém šuplíku, ráno je v kanceláři studená podlaha.\n"
"\n"
"- V."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "CampNet Billing <billing@campnet.local>"
msgstr "CampNet Billing <billing@campnet.local>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Settlement batch cleared"
msgstr "Zúčtovací dávka zpracována"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Settlement batch cleared. One guest record could not be matched to a payment and was carried over."
msgstr "Zúčtovací dávka zpracována. Jeden záznam hosta nebylo možné spárovat s platbou a byl převeden do dalšího období."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json scripts/email_manager.gd:270 scripts/email_manager.gd:272 scripts/os98/apps/mail_app.gd:328
#. uses 4
msgid "(no subject)"
msgstr "(bez předmětu)"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The lamp by the lake was on all night. Good. Keep it on.\n"
"\n"
"Do not walk along the fence after the lamps go out. Your uncle did.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""
"Lampa u jezera svítila celou noc. Dobře. Nech ji svítit.\n"
"\n"
"Až lampy zhasnou, nechoď podél plotu. Strýc chodil.\n"
"\n"
"- V."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Call me"
msgstr "Zavolej mi"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"You did not call. That is fine. I called the camp number instead and somebody picked up and listened for a while.\n"
"\n"
"Was that you?"
msgstr ""
"{g:Nezavolal|Nezavolala} jsi. To nevadí. Tak jsem zavolala na číslo kempu a někdo to zvedl a chvíli poslouchal.\n"
"\n"
"To jsi {g:byl|byla} ty?"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Agrostroj Hlubocany a.s. <obchod@agrostroj.cz>"
msgstr "Agrostroj Hlubočany a.s. <obchod@agrostroj.cz>"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Our offer stands"
msgstr "Naše nabídka platí"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"Dear owner,\n"
"\n"
"Our offer for the land at Cerne jezero stands: 2.4 million crowns, paid at signature. The structures would of course be removed at our cost, the lake left as it is for the cooling water.\n"
"\n"
"We understand the camp has been closed since last summer. Nobody will blame you for selling. Mr Karel H. was close to signing with us last autumn, before the accident.\n"
"\n"
"With respect,\n"
"J. Maly, commercial director"
msgstr ""
"Vážený majiteli,\n"
"\n"
"naše nabídka na pozemky u Černého jezera stále platí: 2,4 milionu korun, splatných při podpisu. Stavby bychom samozřejmě odstranili na vlastní náklady, jezero bychom ponechali, jak je, kvůli chladicí vodě.\n"
"\n"
"Chápeme, že kemp je od loňského léta zavřený. Nikdo Vám nebude mít za zlé, když prodáte. Pan Karel H. byl loni na podzim těsně před podpisem, ještě před tou nehodou.\n"
"\n"
"S úctou\n"
"J. Malý, obchodní ředitel"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tuesdays"
msgstr "V úterý"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"My sister's grandson lets me use his computer on Tuesdays. Everyone in this house is very old.\n"
"\n"
"I hear you have guests. Good. Write them all in the book, even the ones who do not give a name.\n"
"\n"
"If you find a little red shoe anywhere, leave it where it is. Do not bring it in.\n"
"\n"
"- V."
msgstr ""
"Sestřin vnuk mi v úterý půjčuje svůj počítač. V tomhle domě jsou všichni hodně staří.\n"
"\n"
"Slyším, že máš hosty. Dobře. Zapiš je všechny do knihy, i ty, co neřeknou jméno.\n"
"\n"
"Kdybys někde {g:našel|našla} malou červenou botičku, nech ji, kde je. Nenos ji dovnitř.\n"
"\n"
"- V."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tomorrow"
msgstr "Zítra"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "The inspection is tomorrow, right? Whatever they say, I kept your seat on the bus."
msgstr "Prohlídka je zítra, že jo? Ať řeknou cokoliv, místo v autobuse ti držím."

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid "Tomorrow at eight"
msgstr "Zítra v osm"

#: data/pools/emails/story/week01_story.json
msgid ""
"The man from the district comes at eight. I will come out on the first bus and stand next to you; he knew your uncle.\n"
"\n"
"Leave the books on the desk and the terminal on.\n"
"\n"
"I will count them myself.\n"
"\n"
"- Teta Vera"
msgstr ""
"Pán z okresu přijde v osm. Přijedu prvním autobusem a budu stát vedle tebe; znal tvého strýce.\n"
"\n"
"Knihy nech na stole a terminál zapnutý.\n"
"\n"
"Spočítám je sama.\n"
"\n"
"- Teta Věra"

#: scripts/audio_manager.gd:181 scripts/building_interior.gd:3440 scripts/cabin_interior.gd:669 scripts/caravan_life.gd:597 (+24)
