#. uses 4
msgid "Mushroom Pickers"
msgstr "Houbaři"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:95
msgid "A cabin would be best. Somewhere I cannot hear the others."
msgstr "Nejlíp chatku. Někde, kde neuslyším ostatní."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:95
msgid "Not a tent, if it can be helped. I sleep badly under canvas."
msgstr "Pokud to jde, ne stan. Pod plachtou špatně spím."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:96
msgid "a caravan with a fridge would be MINT"
msgstr "karavan s lednicí by byl BOMBA"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:96
msgid "we sleep anywhere honestly. just not next to any grannies"
msgstr "spíme fakt kdekoliv. jen ne vedle nějakejch babek"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:97
msgid "A room with its OWN shower pleeease!!"
msgstr "Pokoj s VLASTNÍ sprchou prosíííím!!"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:97
msgid "Please not a tent, we are not animals :D"
msgstr "Prosím ne stan, nejsme zvířata :D"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:97
msgid "Is the caravan with the little lights free??"
msgstr "Je volnej ten karavan se světýlkama??"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:98
msgid "A tent is fine. The more canvas the better."
msgstr "Stan stačí. Čím víc plachty, tím líp."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:98
msgid "No need for walls. A tent near the fire."
msgstr "Zdi nepotřebujem. Stan u ohně."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:99
msgid "The children are begging for a caravan with bunk beds."
msgstr "Děti škemrají o karavan s palandami."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:99
msgid "Somewhere warm for the kids, please, not a tent."
msgstr "Pro děti prosím něco v teple, ne stan."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:100
msgid "A proper cabin, please. My back cannot do a tent any more."
msgstr "Pořádnou chatku, prosím. Na stan už moje záda nejsou."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:100
msgid "Somewhere quiet, away from any young men. We go to bed at eight."
msgstr "Někde v klidu, daleko od mladých mužských. Chodíme spát v osm."

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:105
msgid ""
"Good day,\n"
"\n"
"I would like a bed for %d person(s), %d night(s). I arrive around %s by bus. I need nothing special. A quiet place, if you have one.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you.\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den,\n"
"\n"
"chtěl bych lůžko pro %d {osobu|osoby|osob} na %d {noc|noci|nocí}. Přijedu kolem %s autobusem. Nic zvláštního nepotřebuji. Klidné místo, jestli máte.\n"
"\n"
"Děkuji.\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:106
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"%d bed(s), %d night(s). Arrival about %s. I will not be any trouble.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den,\n"
"\n"
"%d {lůžko|lůžka|lůžek}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}. Příjezd asi v %s. Nebudu dělat potíže.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:109
msgid ""
"AHOJ CAMP!!!\n"
"\n"
"we are %d lads, %d nights, arriving %s-ish (depends on the pub in Liblice). is the beer cold? is there a pub? if no pub we bring our own. NA ZDRAVI\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"AHOJ KEMPE!!!\n"
"\n"
"je nás %d, na %d {noc|noci|nocí}, dorazíme tak kolem %s (podle toho, jak to dopadne v hospodě v Liblicích). je pivo vychlazený? je tam hospoda? jestli ne, vezmem si vlastní. NA ZDRAVÍ\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:110
msgid ""
"hi\n"
"\n"
"need %d beds for %d nights. coming around %s. do you have a pub. asking for a friend. the friend is me.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"čau\n"
"\n"
"potřebujem %d {postel|postele|postelí} na %d {noc|noci|nocí}. přijedem kolem %s. máte tam hospodu. ptám se za kámoše. ten kámoš jsem já.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:113
msgid ""
"Hiii :)\n"
"\n"
"%d of us, %d nights, we arrive at %s. Is there a slide? A shower with hot water?? We heard the lake is SO pretty at night.\n"
"\n"
"kisses, %s"
msgstr ""
"Ahojkyyy :)\n"
"\n"
"je nás %d, na %d {noc|noci|nocí}, přijedeme v %s. Je tam skluzavka? Sprcha s teplou vodou?? Prý je jezero v noci HROZNĚ krásný.\n"
"\n"
"pusinky, %s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:114
msgid ""
"Hello reception,\n"
"\n"
"Girls weekend!! %d beds, %d nights, arriving %s. Cheapest you have please, we are students.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den, recepce,\n"
"\n"
"holčičí víkend!! %d {postel|postele|postelí}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}, příjezd v %s. To nejlevnější, co máte, prosím, jsme studentky.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:117
msgid ""
"Ahoj,\n"
"\n"
"we are %d from the Vlci stopa tramp settlement. %d nights, coming %s on foot from the station. We bring our own kotlik and guitars. Tent is fine, ground is fine. Is there a fire pit?\n"
"\n"
"TRAMP SE NEVZDAVA - %s"
msgstr ""
"Ahoj,\n"
"\n"
"je nás %d z trampský osady Vlčí stopa. Na %d {noc|noci|nocí}, dorazíme kolem %s pěšky od nádraží. Kotlík a kytary máme vlastní. Stan stačí, zem stačí. Je tam ohniště?\n"
"\n"
"TRAMP SE NEVZDÁVÁ - %s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:118
msgid ""
"Hello camp,\n"
"\n"
"%d tramps, %d nights. Arriving around %s, depends on the trains. We sing until late, we warn you honestly. Kamarade, keep us a spot by the fire.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Ahoj kempe,\n"
"\n"
"%d {tramp|trampové|trampů}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}. Dorazíme kolem %s, podle vlaků. Zpíváme dlouho do noci, upozorňujem rovnou. Kamaráde, nech nám místo u ohně.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:121
msgid ""
"Dear camp,\n"
"\n"
"we are a family of %d (two kids, 6 and 9) looking for %d nights. We arrive by Skoda around %s. Is it safe for children? Is there a playground or a field? Our boy wanders off, is the lake fenced?\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards, %s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den,\n"
"\n"
"jsme rodina, je nás %d (dvě děti, 6 a 9 let), a hledáme ubytování na %d {noc|noci|nocí}. Přijedeme škodovkou kolem %s. Je to u vás bezpečné pro děti? Je tam hřiště nebo louka? Náš kluk se rád zatoulá, je jezero oplocené?\n"
"\n"
"S pozdravem %s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:122
msgid ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Family holiday: %d people, %d nights, arrival about %s. The kids want the slide and my wife wants a clean shower. I want a beer and quiet. Thank you.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den,\n"
"\n"
"rodinná dovolená: %d {osoba|osoby|osob}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}, příjezd kolem %s. Děti chtějí skluzavku a manželka čistou sprchu. Já chci pivo a klid. Děkuji.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:125
msgid ""
"Good day,\n"
"\n"
"We are pensioners, %d person(s), %d nights. We arrive at %s. We go out for mushrooms very early (four o'clock), so we ask for a quiet place away from the young people. Are the boletes growing this year?\n"
"\n"
"Respectfully, %s"
msgstr ""
"Dobrý den,\n"
"\n"
"jsme důchodci, %d {osoba|osoby|osob}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}. Přijedeme v %s. Na houby chodíme velmi brzy (ve čtyři), proto prosíme o klidné místo daleko od mladých. Rostou letos hřiby?\n"
"\n"
"S úctou %s"

#: scripts/email_manager.gd:126
msgid ""
"Dear Sir or Madam,\n"
"\n"
"%d bed(s), %d nights, arrival at %s. We pick mushrooms. We will be gone before you wake up and back by noon. We bring our own knife and basket.\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"Vážení,\n"
"\n"
"%d {lůžko|lůžka|lůžek}, %d {noc|noci|nocí}, příjezd v %s. Sbíráme houby. Odejdeme dřív, než se probudíte, a do poledne jsme zpátky. Nůž a košík máme vlastní.\n"
"\n"
"%s"

