#: scripts/guest_life.gd:191
msgid "Checked in. Let's see this camp."
msgstr "Ubytováno. Tak se mrknem na ten kemp."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:466
msgid "Going to walk to the village and back."
msgstr "Jdu se projít do vesnice a zpátky."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:468
msgid "Going round the lake. Back later."
msgstr "Jdu kolem jezera. Vrátím se pozdějc."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:469
msgid "There's a path into the woods. Going to see where it goes."
msgstr "Do lesa vede pěšina. Jdu zjistit, kam."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:493
msgid "One more beer. Just one. Where did everyone go?"
msgstr "Ještě jedno pivo. Jenom jedno. Kam všichni zmizeli?"

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:495
msgid "Can't sleep. Going to look at the lake."
msgstr "Nemůžu spát. Jdu se podívat na jezero."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:497
msgid "Who's got a guitar? One more song at the fire."
msgstr "Kdo má kytaru? Ještě jednu u ohně."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:499
msgid "Has anyone seen our boy? He was right here."
msgstr "Neviděl někdo našeho kluka? Byl přímo tady."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:501
msgid "Four o'clock. Best time for boletes. Off to the woods."
msgstr "Čtyři ráno. Nejlepší čas na hříbky. Jdu do lesa."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:503
msgid "Heard something outside. Probably nothing."
msgstr "Venku něco bylo slyšet. Asi nic."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:513
msgid "The %s is closed?! Walked all this way."
msgstr "Má to bejt %s, a zavřeno?! Taková štreka."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:525
msgid "A queue for the %s. Of course."
msgstr "Fronta, i tady – %s. No jasně."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:540
msgid "Forget this queue. This camp needs a second %s."
msgstr "Na frontu kašlu. Tohle by tu mělo bejt dvakrát: %s."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:563 scripts/bowling/bowling_interior.gd:426 scripts/food/orders.gd:43 scripts/food/service_life.gd:172
#. uses 4
msgid "%d@%d"
msgstr "%d@%d"

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:610
msgid "That's it. We're leaving. Don't expect a good review."
msgstr "Tak dost. Odjíždíme. Dobrou recenzi nečekej."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:874
msgid "Somebody was singing next door until three."
msgstr "Vedle někdo zpíval až do tří."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:874
msgid "Those lads next door. All night. ALL night."
msgstr "Ti kluci vedle. Celou noc. CELOU noc."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:874
msgid "Put the drunks further away from us, please."
msgstr "Ty ožraly dejte prosím dál od nás."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:876
msgid "Something walked past the tent all night. I'm not imagining it."
msgstr "Celou noc kolem stanu něco chodilo. Nezdá se mi to."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:878
msgid "Barely slept. That bed is a crime."
msgstr "Skoro žádnej spánek. Ta postel je zločin."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:879
msgid "Morning. Smells like pine and diesel."
msgstr "Ráno. Voní to jehličím a naftou."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:879
msgid "Slept like a log."
msgstr "Spalo se jak dřevo."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:879
msgid "Who was whistling at 3 AM?"
msgstr "Kdo to pískal ve tři ráno?"

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:884
msgid "The shower floor is slimy. I came out dirtier."
msgstr "Ve sprše slizká podlaha. Ven člověk leze špinavější."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:884
msgid "Somebody's hair in the drain. A lot of it."
msgstr "V odtoku něčí vlasy. Hodně vlasů."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:884
msgid "The showers stink. Does anyone ever clean them?"
msgstr "Sprchy smrdí. Uklízí je tu vůbec někdo?"

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:885
msgid "The toilets stink. You can smell them from the path."
msgstr "Záchody smrdí. Je to cítit až z cesty."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:885
msgid "Nobody has cleaned that toilet in days."
msgstr "Ten záchod už pár dní nikdo neuklízel."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:885
msgid "I held my breath the whole time in there."
msgstr "Tam uvnitř se nedalo dejchat. Celou dobu."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:891
msgid "Cheap beer, warm bench. Perfect."
msgstr "Levný pivo, teplá lavice. Paráda."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:891
msgid "The pub smells like a wet dog."
msgstr "V hospodě to smrdí jak mokrej pes."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:893
msgid "Goulash was actually decent."
msgstr "Guláš byl vlastně dobrej."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:895
msgid "Bought rohlíky and suspicious salami."
msgstr "Rohlíky a podezřelej salám. Nákup hotovej."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:897
msgid "Sausages on a stick. Childhood unlocked."
msgstr "Buřty na klacku. Zpátky v dětství."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:899
msgid "The slide is terrifying. Again!"
msgstr "Ta skluzavka je děsná. Ještě jednou!"

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:901
msgid "Lost at football to a ten year old."
msgstr "Ve fotbale mě porazil desetiletej kluk."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:903
msgid "Hot water for exactly 40 seconds."
msgstr "Teplá voda přesně na 40 vteřin."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:905
msgid "Sat on the bench and watched the lake. Nice."
msgstr "Sedět na lavičce a koukat na jezero. Krása."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:907
msgid "Bread, salami and a beer at the picnic table. Life is good."
msgstr "Chleba, salám a pivo u stolu venku. Život je krásnej."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:909
msgid "The kids won't come off the swings."
msgstr "Děti nechtěj slízt z houpaček."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:909
msgid "Had a go on the swings. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "Houpačka i pro dospělý. Nikomu to neříkej."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:911
msgid "Lost at ping-pong. The net is crooked, that's why."
msgstr "V ping-pongu mě porazili. Síťka je křivá, proto."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:913
msgid "Fell asleep in the hammock. Best hour of the week."
msgstr "Spánek v houpací síti. Nejlepší hodina celýho týdne."

#: scripts/guest_life.gd:915
msgid "Relief."
msgstr "Úleva."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:131
msgid "Great stay. Quiet enough and staff was helpful."
msgstr "Skvělý pobyt. Dost klidu a ochotný personál."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:132
msgid "Everything worked and the camp felt organized."
msgstr "Všechno fungovalo a kemp působil jako dobře vedený."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:133
msgid "Would book again, smooth check-in and solid facilities."
msgstr "Zase bychom přijeli, ubytování proběhlo hladce, zázemí slušné."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:137
msgid "Stay was fine overall. Nothing major to report."
msgstr "Pobyt celkem v pořádku. Nic zvláštního."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:138
msgid "Average experience, some noise but manageable."
msgstr "Průměr, občas hluk, ale dalo se to vydržet."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:139
msgid "Could be cleaner, but service was acceptable."
msgstr "Mohlo by tu být čistěji, ale obsluha ušla."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:143
msgid "Rough stay. Noise and issues during the night."
msgstr "Těžký pobyt. V noci hluk a potíže."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:144
msgid "Service needs improvement before we return."
msgstr "Než se vrátíme, musí se zlepšit služby."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:145
msgid "Not ideal this time. Camp felt chaotic."
msgstr "Tentokrát nic moc. V kempu byl zmatek."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:420
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "Prázdno"

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:547
msgid "We have been standing at this desk for ages. Is anyone even here?"
msgstr "Stojíme u toho pultu celou věčnost. Je tu vůbec někdo?"

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:659
msgid "Not ready? We booked this weeks ago."
msgstr "Ještě to není připravený? Rezervovali jsme před několika týdny."

#: scripts/guest_manager.gd:710
msgid "Booked, drove all the way, stood at reception for two hours. Nobody came to the desk. Never again."
msgstr "Rezervace, cesta přes půl republiky, dvě hodiny na recepci. K pultu nikdo nepřišel. Nikdy víc."

