#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:149
msgid "The books balance and the guests write nice things. The district has withdrawn the sale; Agrostroj can build their mill somewhere else. The winter is yours, if you want it."
msgstr "Účty sedí a hosté píšou hezké věci. Okres prodej stáhl; Agrostroj si může postavit míchárnu jinde. Zima je tvoje, jestli o ni stojíš."

#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:151
msgid "We are down in places, but standing, and the district says a camp that is open is a camp that is open. The sale is off, for now. Stay on into the winter, if you can bear it."
msgstr "Místy to drhne, ale stojíme, a okres říká, že otevřený kemp je otevřený kemp. Prodej se zatím ruší. Zůstaň přes zimu, jestli to vydržíš."

#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:153
msgid "I have read the reviews and the bank statement, and so has the district. They will recommend the sale. Agrostroj's men were here on Friday with their pegs and their tape. It was never your fault. Your bus is at ten."
msgstr "Četla jsem recenze i výpis z banky a okres taky. Doporučí prodej. V pátek tu byli lidi z Agrostroje s kolíky a pásmem. Nikdy to nebyla tvoje vina. Autobus ti jede v deset."

#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:157
msgid "I counted them myself. %d in the book, %d at breakfast. I counted twice, because it is never right."
msgstr "Spočítala jsem je sama. %d v knize, %d u snídaně. Počítala jsem dvakrát, protože to nikdy nesedí."

#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:159
msgid "I counted them myself. %d in the book, %d at breakfast. One of them was standing by the fence, facing the office. He was your uncle's too."
msgstr "Spočítala jsem je sama. %d v knize, %d u snídaně. Jeden z nich stál u plotu, čelem ke kanceláři. Býval tu už za tvého strýce."

#: scripts/week_ledger.gd:161
msgid "I counted them myself. %d in the book, %d at breakfast. It was like that when your uncle ran it."
msgstr "Spočítala jsem je sama. %d v knize, %d u snídaně. Za tvého strýce to bylo stejné."

