#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:80 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:115 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:120
#. uses 3
msgid "It's the camp at the reservoir."
msgstr "Tady kemp u přehrady."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:81
msgid "The guest register goes in GuestRack. We have told Mrs Kralova twice. Good day."
msgstr "Evidence ubytovaných se vede v GuestRacku. Paní Královou jsme upozorňovali dvakrát. Na shledanou."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:83
msgid "WATER BOARD"
msgstr "VODÁRNY"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:83
msgid "Water board. Blockages inside the camp are the operator's responsibility. Do not flush rags."
msgstr "Vodárny. Za ucpání uvnitř areálu kempu odpovídá provozovatel. Nesplachujte hadry."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:85
msgid "BUS STATION"
msgstr "AUT. NÁDRAŽÍ"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:85
msgid "Hlubocany bus station. Line three-eighty, Lstibor, Liblice, Pristoupim, Cerne jezero: from Liblice at five thirty, thirteen oh five and eighteen thirty. The last bus back from the camp leaves at nineteen fifteen."
msgstr "Autobusové nádraží Hlubočany. Linka tři sta osmdesát, Lstiboř, Liblice, Přistoupim, Černé jezero: z Liblic v pět třicet, ve třináct nula pět a v osmnáct třicet. Poslední spoj zpátky od kempu odjíždí v devatenáct patnáct."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:90
msgid "Jednota u Marku, Liblice."
msgstr "Jednota u Marků, Liblice."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:91
msgid "It's Vera's camp."
msgstr "Tady Věřin kemp."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:92
msgid "Bread comes with the van. And tell Vera the crates are hers to bring back."
msgstr "Chleba vozí auto. A vyřiďte Věře, že basy má vrátit ona."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:96 scripts/os98/apps/job_adclick.gd:27
#. uses 2
msgid "U JEZERA"
msgstr "U JEZERA"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:97
msgid "U Jezera!"
msgstr "U Jezera!"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:98
msgid "It's the camp. Is anyone from the camp with you?"
msgstr "Tady kemp. Je u vás někdo z kempu?"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:99
msgid "What? I can't hear you, the jukebox is on. Come down if you want a drink!"
msgstr "Cože? Neslyším, hraje jukebox. Jestli se chceš napít, přijď dolů!"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:102 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:103
#. uses 2
msgid "POWER FAULTS"
msgstr "PORUCHY PROUDU"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:102
msgid "Hlubocany District Power, faults. Our crews do not go out to the reservoir after dark. Call your electrician."
msgstr "Energetika Hlubočany, poruchy. Naše čety k přehradě po setmění nejezdí. Zavolejte si svého elektrikáře."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:104
msgid "District Power, faults."
msgstr "Energetika, poruchy."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:105
msgid "The camp at the reservoir. The main keeps tripping."
msgstr "Kemp u přehrady. Pořád nám padá hlavní jistič."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:106
msgid "Your side of the meter is your electrician's job. Novotny, isn't it? His number's in the book."
msgstr "Za elektroměrem je to věc vašeho elektrikáře. Novotný, ne? Číslo máte v seznamu."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:109 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:113
#. uses 2
msgid "POLICE"
msgstr "POLICIE"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:110 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:114
#. uses 2
msgid "Police, Hlubocany."
msgstr "Policie, Hlubočany."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:111
msgid "It's the camp at the reservoir. Someone is out by the fence."
msgstr "Tady kemp u přehrady. U plotu někdo je."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:112
msgid "The camp. Right. Lock the office door and stay inside. We will send someone in the morning."
msgstr "Kemp. Aha. Zamkněte kancelář a zůstaňte uvnitř. Ráno někoho pošleme."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:116
msgid "Lost property is on Wednesdays. Is there anything else?"
msgstr "Ztráty a nálezy jsou ve středu. Ještě něco?"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:118
msgid "AMBULANCE"
msgstr "ZÁCHRANKA"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:119
msgid "Emergency."
msgstr "Záchranná služba."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:121
msgid "Is anyone hurt? The forest road is closed to us after dark. Bandage it and ring in the morning."
msgstr "Je někdo zraněný? Na lesní cestu po setmění nejezdíme. Obvažte to a zavolejte ráno."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:123
msgid "EUROTEL"
msgstr "EUROTEL"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:123
msgid "The mobile subscriber is unavailable. Please call later."
msgstr "Volaný účastník je dočasně nedostupný. Volejte prosím později."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:125
msgid "This is Vera Kralova. If it is about the camp, the camp is fine."
msgstr "Tady Věra Králová. Jestli jde o kemp, kemp je v pořádku."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:127
msgid "This is Vera Kralova. If it is about the camp, count them again."
msgstr "Tady Věra Králová. Jestli jde o kemp, přepočítejte je."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:130 scripts/os98/apps/job_census.gd:227
#. uses 2
msgid "TIME"
msgstr "ČAS"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:130
msgid "At the third stroke it will be %s."
msgstr "Při třetím tónu bude %s."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:137
msgid "(water, dripping, close to the receiver)"
msgstr "(voda, kape, těsně u sluchátka)"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:138
msgid "Hello? Mr Hruby?"
msgstr "Haló? Pane Hrubý?"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:139
msgid "(a breath, a long one, as if through a wet cloth)"
msgstr "(nádech, dlouhý, jako přes mokrý hadr)"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:146 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:154 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:156 scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:162 (+2)
#. uses 6
msgid "NOVOTNY"
msgstr "NOVOTNÝ"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:146
msgid "I said I'm on my way. Don't ring again."
msgstr "Říkal jsem, že jedu. Už nevolej."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:150
msgid "Novotny."
msgstr "Novotný."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:151
msgid "It's the camp at the reservoir. The power."
msgstr "Tady kemp u přehrady. Proud."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:153
msgid "Vera's place. The main again. Right, I'll come out. Half an hour. Sixty for the call-out."
msgstr "U Věry. Zase jistič. Dobře, přijedu. Za půl hodiny. Šest stovek za výjezd."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:155
msgid "Nothing's broken? Then I'm not driving out to look at a working box."
msgstr "Nic není rozbitý? Tak to nepojedu koukat na skříň, co funguje."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:158
msgid "Mm. Novotny."
msgstr "Mhm. Novotný."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:159
msgid "It's the camp at the reservoir. The power's out."
msgstr "Tady kemp u přehrady. Nejde proud."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:161
msgid "No. Not tonight. I drove past there an hour ago and I didn't stop. Ring me in the morning."
msgstr "Ne. Dneska ne. Před hodinou jsem tam jel kolem a nezastavil jsem. Zavolej ráno."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:164
msgid "Then why are you ringing me at this hour?"
msgstr "Tak proč mi voláš v takovou hodinu?"

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:166
msgid "It's gone nine. Double after nine: a hundred and twenty. I'll be an hour. Leave the barrier up."
msgstr "Je po deváté. Po deváté dvojnásob: dvanáct stovek. Budu tam za hodinu. Nech závoru nahoře."

#: scripts/closeup/phone_book.gd:188
msgid "%d:%02d precisely"
msgstr "přesně %d:%02d"

