#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:83
msgid "tapping on the office window"
msgstr "ťukání na okno kanceláře"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:84
msgid "a person outside the office window, facing it"
msgstr "postava za oknem kanceláře, čelem k němu"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:85
msgid "knocking at the office door. Nobody. Wet prints on the step"
msgstr "klepání na dveře kanceláře. Nikdo. Mokré stopy na schodku"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:86
msgid "knocking at the office door: two, then one"
msgstr "klepání na dveře kanceláře: dvakrát, pak jednou"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:87
msgid "the office door handle tried from outside"
msgstr "někdo zvenku zkoušel kliku kanceláře"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:88
msgid "the office phone rang. Breathing on the line"
msgstr "v kanceláři zazvonil telefon. Na lince dech"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:89
msgid "something along the back room's outer wall"
msgstr "něco podél venkovní stěny zadní místnosti"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:90
msgid "the radio lost the station"
msgstr "rádio ztratilo stanici"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:91
msgid "the office not as it was left"
msgstr "kancelář jinak, než jak zůstala"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:92
msgid "a lamp went out by itself, then came back"
msgstr "lampa sama zhasla a pak se zase rozsvítila"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:93
msgid "steps following the night staff across the camp"
msgstr "kroky za noční službou přes celý kemp"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:94
msgid "a call from the woods"
msgstr "volání z lesa"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:95
msgid "a person crossing the camp in the dark. Prints"
msgstr "postava přešla kemp potmě. Stopy"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:96
msgid "something at the edge of the camp"
msgstr "něco na okraji kempu"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:97
msgid "movement in a guest's cabin while they slept"
msgstr "pohyb v chatce hosta, zatímco spal"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:98
msgid "a light in the woods where there is no lamp"
msgstr "světlo v lese, kde žádná lampa není"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:99
msgid "a branch snapped in the dark near the night staff"
msgstr "potmě u noční služby praskla větev"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:100
msgid "%s stood at the edge of the trees, facing the office. In the morning: never got up"
msgstr "%s u kraje stromů, čelem ke kanceláři. Ráno už z postele nevstává"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:101
msgid "the insects stopped all at once"
msgstr "hmyz najednou zmlkl"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:102
msgid "a cabin door banged; nobody came out"
msgstr "bouchly dveře chatky; nikdo nevyšel"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:103
msgid "steps in the back room, which was empty"
msgstr "kroky v zadní místnosti, která byla prázdná"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:104
msgid "a face for a moment where there was none"
msgstr "na okamžik tvář tam, kde žádná nebyla"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:105
msgid "the office tube stuttered"
msgstr "zářivka v kanceláři zablikala"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:106
msgid "the main breaker went, right after"
msgstr "hned potom vypadl hlavní jistič"

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:131
msgid "It keeps to the edges and does not like to be looked at. Look straight at what you see."
msgstr "Drží se při krajích a nemá rádo, když se na něj někdo dívá. Dívej se přímo na to, co vidíš."

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:132
msgid "It sounds like us. Count the knocks, listen to the steps: something will be slightly off."
msgstr "Zní jako my. Počítej zaklepání, poslouchej kroky: něco bude trochu jinak."

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:133
msgid "Things get moved. Remember how you leave a room, and put it back."
msgstr "Věci se přesouvají. Pamatuj si, jak místnost opouštíš, a vrať to zpátky."

#: scripts/night/night_director.gd:134
msgid "Something hunts tonight. Lamps, light, and the procedures below."
msgstr "Dnes v noci něco loví. Lampy, světlo a postupy níže."

