#: scripts/os98/web_pages.gd:798
msgid "..:: INFRAVRANY ::.. official page"
msgstr "..:: INFRAVRANY ::.. oficiální stránka"

#: scripts/os98/web_pages.gd:801
msgid ""
"[center][font_size=26][b][color=#cc0000]..:: INFRAVRANY ::..[/color][/b][/font_size]\n"
"[color=#888888]heavy rock from Hlubocany since 1995[/color]\n"
"{{img:web_band:240}}\n"
"[color=#ffffff][i]Lukas, Mira, Pepa, Standa - the old swimming pool, spring 98[/i][/color][/center]\n"
"[bgcolor=#330000][color=#ff9900][b][marquee w=560 speed=44]*** NEW DEMO TAPE \"POD HLADINOU\" - 50 Kc at gigs or from Lukas ***[/marquee][/b][/color][/bgcolor]\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#ffffff]GIGS 1998[/color][/b]\n"
" 20.6.  Hlubocany, culture house - played\n"
"  4.7.  Liblice, fire station ball - played\n"
" 11.7.  Kemp Cerne jezero, disco - [color=#ff3333][blink]CANCELLED[/blink][/color]\n"
" 25.7.  Jihlava, club Rubin - tickets 40 Kc\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ff9900]about the camp gig:[/color] Vera says the disco is off this year. we played there last summer and it was the best gig we ever did, 200 people, the lake, everything. Pepa says there was a guy in a hat by the door all night who just stood there. he was there at the end when we packed up. the bus had gone and he was still standing in the same place\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#ffffff]LYRICS: POD HLADINOU[/color][/b]\n"
"[i]they count us at ten\n"
"they count us at twelve\n"
"one more in the water\n"
"than there is in the world\n"
"\n"
"down under the surface\n"
"the bells of the village\n"
"somebody knocking\n"
"somebody knocking[/i]\n"
"\n"
"[color=#888888](Mira wrote this one after the camp. he wont say what it means)[/color]\n"
msgstr ""
"[center][font_size=26][b][color=#cc0000]..:: INFRAVRANY ::..[/color][/b][/font_size]\n"
"[color=#888888]tvrdý rock z Hlubočan od roku 1995[/color]\n"
"{{img:web_band:240}}\n"
"[color=#ffffff][i]Lukáš, Míra, Pepa, Standa - starý koupaliště, jaro 98[/i][/color][/center]\n"
"[bgcolor=#330000][color=#ff9900][b][marquee w=560 speed=44]*** NOVÁ DEMOKAZETA „POD HLADINOU“ - 50 Kč na koncertech nebo u Lukáše ***[/marquee][/b][/color][/bgcolor]\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#ffffff]KONCERTY 1998[/color][/b]\n"
" 20.6.  Hlubočany, kulturní dům - odehráno\n"
"  4.7.  Liblice, hasičský ples - odehráno\n"
" 11.7.  Kemp Černé jezero, diskotéka - [color=#ff3333][blink]ZRUŠENO[/blink][/color]\n"
" 25.7.  Jihlava, klub Rubín - vstupenky 40 Kč\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ff9900]ke koncertu v kempu:[/color] Věra říká, že letos diskotéka nebude. hráli jsme tam loni v létě a byl to nejlepší koncert, co jsme kdy měli, 200 lidí, jezero, všechno. Pepa říká, že u dveří celou noc stál nějakej chlap v klobouku a jenom tam stál. byl tam ještě na konci, když jsme balili. autobus už odjel a on pořád stál na stejným místě\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#ffffff]TEXT: POD HLADINOU[/color][/b]\n"
"[i]počítají nás v deset\n"
"počítají nás ve dvanáct\n"
"o jednoho víc ve vodě\n"
"než je nás na světě\n"
"\n"
"dole pod hladinou\n"
"zvony vesnice\n"
"někdo klepe\n"
"někdo klepe[/i]\n"
"\n"
"[color=#888888](Míra to napsal po tom kempu. neřekne, co to znamená)[/color]\n"

