msgid "The 380's ticket machine. Pick a fare, then coins in the slot."
msgstr "Automat linky 380. Vyber si zastávku, pak mince do otvoru."

#: scripts/town/ticket_machine_closeup.gd:79 scripts/town/ticket_machine_closeup.gd:80
#. uses 2
