msgstr "do Lstiboře %s"

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:81
msgid "Přistoupim, Liblice"
msgstr "Přistoupim, Liblice"

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:86
msgid "Spoj %s zde nestaví."
msgstr "Spoj %s zde nestaví."

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:87
msgid "NEMÁVAT!"
msgstr "NEMÁVAT!"

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:118
msgid "směr: "
msgstr "směr: "

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:119
msgid "ČSAD KOLÍN"
msgstr "ČSAD KOLÍN"

#: scripts/town/timetable_closeup.gd:141
msgid "platí od 31.5.1998"
msgstr "platí od 31.5.1998"

#: scripts/town/town_lesna.gd:340
msgid "%s|tiled|%s|%s"
msgstr "%s|tiled|%s|%s"

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:36
msgid "Mrs Hruba"
msgstr "Paní Hrubá"

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:38
msgid "You are from the camp. I can tell by the boots. That black mud is the lake."
msgstr "Ty jsi z kempu. Poznám to podle bot. To černý bahno, to je jezero."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:39
msgid "My Karel kept the boats up there thirty years. One night he rowed out to fetch something. The boat came back by itself."
msgstr "Můj Karel tam nahoře třicet let hlídal loďky. Jednou v noci si pro něco vyjel na vodu. Loďka se vrátila sama."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:40
msgid "There is a photograph of his on your board, I expect. The lake from the jetty. Look at the middle of it."
msgstr "Na nástěnce u vás bude asi jeho fotka. Jezero z mola. Podívej se doprostřed."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:41
msgid "Vera used to bring me eggs from the camp. Then she stopped coming down. Then she stopped."
msgstr "Věra mi z kempu nosívala vajíčka. Pak přestala chodit dolů. Pak přestala."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:42
msgid "Do not buy the sausages on a Monday."
msgstr "V pondělí nekupuj buřty."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:44
msgid "You should not be out. Go to the motel, Simek keeps a light on."
msgstr "{g:Neměl|Neměla} bys být venku. Jdi do motelu, Šimek tam nechává svítit."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:47
msgid "The bus? Three a day. The last one up to you goes at half past six. Nobody goes up there after dark anyway."
msgstr "Autobus? Tři denně. Poslední nahoru k vám jede v půl sedmý. Po tmě tam stejně nikdo nejezdí."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:48
msgid "The works bus at midnight goes up to the dam. Nobody gets on, nobody gets off. My cousin drives it. He says it is heavier coming back."
msgstr "O půlnoci jede služebák nahoru k přehradě. Nikdo nenastoupí, nikdo nevystoupí. Řídí ho můj bratranec. Říká, že zpátky je těžší."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:49
msgid "Lesnak's at the Jednota. Ten degrees. Tastes like the reservoir."
msgstr "Lesňák maj v Jednotě. Desítka. Chutná jak přehrada."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:50
msgid "They say your register never adds up. More people in the beds than in the book."
msgstr "Prej vám nikdy nesedí evidence. Víc lidí v postelích než v knize."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:51
msgid "Lojza at the Benzina down by your turn pays cash if you can hold a nozzle steady. Do not ask him about the Tatra."
msgstr "Lojza na Benzině dole u vaší odbočky platí na ruku, když udržíš pistoli v klidu. Na tu Tatru se ho neptej."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:53
msgid "Pub's open. Kubat won't let you in the cellar, don't ask."
msgstr "Hospoda je otevřená. Do sklepa tě Kubát nepustí, neptej se."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:53
msgid "Listen. No dogs tonight. When the dogs stop, I go home."
msgstr "Poslouchej. Dneska psi neštěkaj. Když psi zmlknou, jdu domů."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:59
msgid "A beer is a dollar. The second one is a dollar too. The tenth one, we talk."
msgstr "Pivo za deset. Druhý taky za deset. U desátýho se domluvíme."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:61
msgid "Last orders at eleven. After that I lock the door and I do not open it, whoever knocks. Whoever."
msgstr "V jedenáct poslední runda. Pak zamykám a neotevřu, ať klepe kdo chce. Kdokoli."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:62 scripts/town/town_room.gd:233 scripts/town/town_room.gd:530 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:436 (+4)
#. uses 8
msgid "Mr Simek"
msgstr "Pan Šimek"

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:64
msgid "A room is fifteen. Breakfast is a promise, not a guarantee."
msgstr "Pokoj za sto padesát. Snídaně je slib, ne záruka."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:65
msgid "Your camp people stay here when they miss the bus. Some of them. Some just stand in the car park all night looking up the road."
msgstr "Lidi z vašeho kempu tu přespávají, když jim ujede autobus. Někteří. Jiní jen celou noc stojí na parkovišti a koukají nahoru po silnici."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:66
msgid "Do not open the window in number six. It does not open, but do not."
msgstr "V šestce neotvírej okno. Nejde otevřít, ale neotvírej ho."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:68
msgid "Fifteen dollars. Key's on the board. Lock it twice."
msgstr "Sto padesát korun. Klíč visí na tabuli. Zamkni dvakrát."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:69
msgid "Sgt Vavra"
msgstr "Strážmistr Vávra"

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:71
msgid "The camp? You are the new one up there. The district has been asking about your register."
msgstr "Kemp? Vy jste {g:ten nový|ta nová} nahoře. Okres se ptal na vaši evidenci ubytovaných."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:72
msgid "Persons found in a facility who are not in the register are not the district's responsibility. It is on the notice. Read it."
msgstr "Za osoby nalezené v zařízení, které nejsou v evidenci, okres neodpovídá. Stojí to na vyhlášce. Přečtěte si ji."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:73
msgid "In ninety-four a man walked in out of the forest with a camp key in his hand. He could not say his name. Still can't."
msgstr "V devadesátém čtvrtém vyšel z lesa muž s klíčem od kempu v ruce. Nedokázal říct své jméno. Dodnes nedokáže."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:74
msgid "Off the road at night. The works bus does not brake."
msgstr "V noci z cesty pryč. Služební autobus nebrzdí."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:76
msgid "Home. Now."
msgstr "Domů. Hned."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:79
msgid "Have you seen the man in the corn? My brother has. He won't say what he looks like."
msgstr "{g:Viděl|Viděla} jsi toho chlapa v kukuřici? Brácha jo. Nechce říct, jak vypadá."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:80
msgid "Bet you a crown you won't swim in your lake at night."
msgstr "Vsadím se o korunu, že se v noci ve vašem jezeře nevykoupeš."

#: scripts/town/town_people.gd:81
msgid "My bike's faster than the bus. The bus doesn't stop for anybody after dark."
msgstr "Moje kolo je rychlejší než autobus. Autobus po tmě nezastaví nikomu."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:45
msgid "Rychla kacka. Scratch it at home, not on my counter."
msgstr "Rychlá kačka. Stírej ji doma, ne na mým pultu."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:63
msgid "Saint Prokop, in brown, a book under his arm. The paint has gone from his hands where they have been touched."
msgstr "Svatý Prokop v hnědém, knihu pod paží. Na rukou, kde se ho lidé dotýkali, je barva pryč."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:64
msgid "Somebody has tucked a folded note behind his foot. You leave it there."
msgstr "Někdo mu za nohu zastrčil složený lístek. Necháš ho tam."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:67
msgid "The painting is too dark to make out. A figure in a boat, maybe. Water, certainly."
msgstr "Obraz je moc tmavý, není nic poznat. Možná postava v loďce. Voda určitě."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:68
msgid "Paper flowers, the colour gone out of them. A fresh one among them, red."
msgstr "Papírové květiny, vybledlé. Mezi nimi jedna čerstvá, červená."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:71
msgid "A hymn book left open. Somebody has underlined a line in pencil and rubbed it out again."
msgstr "Otevřený kancionál. Někdo v něm tužkou podtrhl řádek a zase ho vygumoval."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:72
msgid "Scratched into the pew in front, small: V. + K. 1971."
msgstr "Do lavice vpředu vyryto, malé: V. + K. 1971."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:75
msgid "Pump first, then pay. Or pay, then pump. Just pay."
msgstr "Nejdřív natankovat, pak zaplatit. Nebo zaplatit, pak natankovat. Hlavně zaplatit."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:76
msgid "Lojza says you are good at the pumps. Lojza says a lot."
msgstr "Lojza říká, že ti to u stojanů jde. Lojza toho napovídá."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:77
msgid "Maps of the district, forty crowns, eight years old. The roads have not moved."
msgstr "Mapy okresu, čtyřicet korun, osm let staré. Silnice se nehnuly."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:80
msgid "Rooms from seven in the evening. Fifteen dollars."
msgstr "Pokoje od sedmi večer. Sto padesát korun."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:81
msgid "The camp people used to come down for the shower. Then they stopped coming down at all."
msgstr "Lidi z kempu sem chodívali dolů na sprchu. Pak přestali chodit úplně."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:82
msgid "Number four has the best mattress. Number six I do not let."
msgstr "Ve čtyřce je nejlepší matrace. Šestku nepronajímám."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Camp up the lake, is it. My brother worked the boats there. Before."
msgstr "Z kempu nahoře u jezera, co? Brácha tam dělal na loďkách. Dřív."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Do not swim at night. Nobody tells you that, so I am telling you."
msgstr "V noci se nekoupej. Nikdo ti to neřekne, tak ti to říkám já."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "Kubat, another."
msgstr "Kubáte, ještě jedno."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:85
msgid "The bus driver does not stop at the cross after dark. Ask him why. He will not say."
msgstr "Řidič po setmění u křížku nestaví. Zeptej se ho proč. Neřekne."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "You buying? No? Then why are you at my bar."
msgstr "Platíš? Ne? Tak co děláš u mýho pultu."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "I drove for the JZD. Twenty years. The silo has a cellar nobody filled in."
msgstr "Jezdil jsem pro JZD. Dvacet let. Pod silem je sklep, co ho nikdo nezasypal."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:86
msgid "Na zdravi, camp."
msgstr "Na zdraví, kempaři."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:228
msgid "Cold, and the smell of wax."
msgstr "Chladno a vůně vosku."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:231 scripts/town/town_room.gd:511 scripts/town/town_room.gd:515 scripts/town/town_room.gd:518 (+1)
#. uses 5
msgid "Mrs Lojzova"
msgstr "Paní Lojzová"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:231
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "Prosím?"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:233
msgid "Evening. Or is it."
msgstr "Dobrý večer. Jestli je dobrý."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:317
msgid "Go out   [S]"
msgstr "Odejít   [S]"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:440
msgid "And where will you put it? Your bag is full."
msgstr "A kam to dáš? Brašnu máš plnou."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:481 scripts/town/town_room.gd:751
#. uses 2
msgid "Regular"
msgstr "Štamgast"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:489
msgid "There is no room left on the stand."
msgstr "Na stojanu už není místo."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:494
msgid "You light a candle. The others lean towards it, then stand straight again."
msgstr "Zapálíš svíčku. Ostatní se k ní nakloní a zase se narovnají."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:494
msgid "Another one."
msgstr "Další."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:515
msgid "Your bag is full, love. Make room first."
msgstr "Brašnu máš plnou, zlato. Nejdřív si udělej místo."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:518
msgid "Start is three dollars here. Two at the Jednota. Go to the Jednota."
msgstr "Start je tady za třicet. V Jednotě za dvacet. Běž do Jednoty."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:522
msgid "Start. Three dollars, it is a petrol station. Mind the pumps with that."
msgstr "Start. Třicet korun, je to benzínka. A u stojanů s tím opatrně."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:539
msgid "A can of lemonade drops, warm. The light in the machine flickers off and on again."
msgstr "Vypadne plechovka limonády, teplá. Světlo v automatu zhasne a zase se rozsvítí."

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:551
msgid "Candle"
msgstr "Candle"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:651
msgid "Box"
msgstr "Box"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:660
msgid "Sprite"
msgstr "Sprite"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:780
msgid "Scales"
msgstr "Scales"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:792
msgid "Goods"
msgstr "Goods"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:839
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "Bar"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:842
msgid "Taps"
msgstr "Taps"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:856
msgid "Machine"
msgstr "Machine"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:870
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Table"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:882
msgid "Dartboard"
msgstr "Dartboard"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:904
msgid "Altar"
msgstr "Altar"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:906
msgid "Saint"
msgstr "Saint"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:908
msgid "Crucifix"
msgstr "Crucifix"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:922
msgid "Stained"
msgstr "Stained"

#: scripts/town/town_room.gd:933
msgid "Candles"
msgstr "Candles"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:54
msgid "Machine's inside. I don't do change."
msgstr "Automat je vevnitř. Rozměňovat nebudu."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:55
msgid "Twenty years on the 380. I never once saw anybody get off at your camp after dark."
msgstr "Dvacet let jezdím třistaosmdesátku. Ani jednou jsem neviděl, že by u vašeho kempu někdo po setmění vystoupil."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:56
msgid "Five minutes. Then I go, with you or without you."
msgstr "Pět minut. Pak jedu, s tebou nebo bez tebe."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:57
msgid "The works bus? Not mine. Nobody's, if you ask me."
msgstr "Služebák? Ten není můj. Podle mě ničí."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:65
msgid "Work? Grab a nozzle. Green's Natural, yellow's Special, black's diesel. Mix them up and I mix you up."
msgstr "Práce? Chytni pistoli. Zelená je Natural, žlutá Special, černá nafta. Spleteš je a já si to s tebou vyřídím."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:66
msgid "Paid by the car, and they tip if you stop it right on the money."
msgstr "Platí se od auta, a když to zastavíš přesně na částce, dají dýško."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:67
msgid "That Tatra comes through at night sometimes, no plates, never pays. I just fill it. You would too."
msgstr "Ta Tatra tudy občas v noci jede, bez značek, nikdy nezaplatí. Prostě ji natankuju. Ty bys taky."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:68
msgid "Everything off the twelve stops here. The ones going up to your camp fill up like they are not coming back."
msgstr "Všechno, co jede po dvanáctce, tady staví. Ti, co jedou nahoru k vašemu kempu, tankujou, jako by se už nevraceli."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:70
msgid "Closed. Go to bed."
msgstr "Zavřeno. Jdi spát."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:71
msgid "1914 - 1918, nine names. 1939 - 1945, four. Under them a newer brass plate, screwed on crooked: CERNE JEZERO 1994. No names. Somebody keeps it polished."
msgstr "1914 - 1918, devět jmen. 1939 - 1945, čtyři. Pod nimi novější mosazná deska, přišroubovaná nakřivo: ČERNÉ JEZERO 1994. Žádná jména. Někdo ji udržuje vyleštěnou."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:72
msgid "Locked. A card in the window: mass at nine on Sundays, the bell at noon and at six. Under it, in pencil: and at three in the morning, but that is not us."
msgstr "Zamčeno. Za sklem lístek: mše v neděli v devět, zvoní se v poledne a v šest. Pod tím tužkou: a ve tři ráno, ale to nejsme my."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:137
msgid "That's better."
msgstr "Hned je líp."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:211
msgid "Lower the barrier"
msgstr "Spustit závoru"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:211
msgid "Raise the barrier"
msgstr "Zvednout závoru"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:215
msgid "Buy a ticket"
msgstr "Koupit jízdenku"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:217
msgid "Get on the bus"
msgstr "Nastoupit do autobusu"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:221
msgid "Read the memorial"
msgstr "Přečíst pomník"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:225
msgid "Fill the petrol can"
msgstr "Naplnit kanystr"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:225
msgid "Look at the pump"
msgstr "Prohlédnout stojan"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:229
msgid "Fill the car"
msgstr "Natankovat auto"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:231
msgid "Ask Lojza for work"
msgstr "Požádat Lojzu o práci"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:234
msgid "Talk to Lojza"
msgstr "Promluvit s Lojzou"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:238
msgid "Read the note on the door"
msgstr "Přečíst lístek na dveřích"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:240
msgid "Go into the pub"
msgstr "Jít do hospody"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:240
msgid "Knock"
msgstr "Zaklepat"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:242
msgid "Ask for a room"
msgstr "Zeptat se na pokoj"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:244
msgid "Knock on the kiosk window"
msgstr "Zaklepat na okénko"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:246
msgid "Try the chapel door"
msgstr "Zkusit dveře kaple"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:311
msgid "Come back when I have got cars. Mornings are best, the Tatra is gone by then."
msgstr "Přijď, až budou auta. Nejlíp ráno, to už je Tatra pryč."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:318
msgid "Wait for one. They come."
msgstr "Počkej na nějaký. Jezdí."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:348
msgid "The pump is locked for the night. A card on it: 6 - 21."
msgstr "Stojan je na noc zamčený. Na něm cedulka: 6 - 21."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:350
msgid "Ten litres of Natural is $%d at the kiosk window. You have not got it."
msgstr "Deset litrů Naturalu stojí u okénka $%d. Tolik nemáš."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:353
msgid "Ten litres of Natural into the can, $%d through the kiosk window. It smells of the whole of 1985."
msgstr "Deset litrů Naturalu do kanystru, $%d okénkem. Voní celým rokem 1985."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:357
msgid "Self-service: fill up, then pay at the kiosk window. You have nothing to fill."
msgstr "Samoobsluha: natankuj, pak zaplať u okénka. Nemáš co plnit."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:367
msgid "Right. Cars come in, you fill them. Green Natural, yellow Special, black diesel. Two dollars a car and whatever they tip. Mix them up and it is ten off you."
msgstr "Dobře. Přijede auto, natankuješ ho. Zelená Natural, žlutá Special, černá nafta. Dvacet korun za auto a co dají dýška. Spleteš to a strhnu ti stovku."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:386
msgid "A card on the glass: JEDNOTA U MARKŮ, LIBLICE 42. Mon - Fri 7 - 17, Sat 7 - 11. Batteries sold out."
msgstr "Na skle cedulka: JEDNOTA U MARKŮ, LIBLICE 42. Po - Pá 7 - 17, So 7 - 11. Baterie vyprodány."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:391
msgid "Shut. I do not open after eleven, whoever knocks."
msgstr "Zavřeno. Po jedenácté neotvírám, ať klepe kdo chce."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:398
msgid "The kiosk window is dark. Oil cans, maps, a calendar with a car on it."
msgstr "Okénko je tmavé. Plechovky oleje, mapy, kalendář s autem."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:436 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:487
#. uses 2
msgid "Rooms from seven in the evening. Sit on the bench if you are tired."
msgstr "Pokoje od sedmi večer. Jestli jsi {g:unavený|unavená}, sedni si na lavičku."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:439 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:490
#. uses 2
msgid "Fifteen dollars. The bench by the pond is free."
msgstr "Sto padesát korun. Lavička u rybníka je zadarmo."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:495
msgid "Number four. Lock it twice."
msgstr "Čtyřka. Zamkni dvakrát."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:745
msgid "Morning. The radiator knocked all night. Twice it knocked back."
msgstr "Ráno. Topení klepalo celou noc. Dvakrát mu něco odpovědělo."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:812 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:822 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:879
#. uses 3
msgid "SLUZEBNI"
msgstr "SLUŽEBNÍ"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:884 scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1263
#. uses 2
msgid "LSTIBOR"
msgstr "LSTIBOŘ"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1078
msgid "Driver: \"Lstibor. Yours is the other side, to the camp.\""
msgstr "Řidič: „Lstiboř. Váš jede z druhé strany, do kempu.“"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1087
msgid "Driver: \"Staff only. Yours is the 380.\""
msgstr "Řidič: „Služební, jen pro personál. Vy jedete třistaosmdesátkou.“"

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1277
msgid "No room in the bag for a ticket."
msgstr "V brašně není místo na jízdenku."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1280
msgid "Two dollars. You have not got two dollars."
msgstr "Dvacet korun. Dvacet korun nemáš."

#: scripts/town/town_trip.gd:1291
msgid "A ticket for the 380. Punch it on the bus, in the orange box."
msgstr "Jízdenka na třistaosmdesátku. Označ ji v autobuse v oranžovém štípači."

#: scripts/ui/boot_screen.gd:66
msgid ""
"\n"
"shader_type canvas_item;\n"
"uniform sampler2D fill : filter_nearest, repeat_enable;\n"
"uniform float px = 4.0;\n"
"void fragment() {\n"
"\tvec4 c = texture(TEXTURE, UV) * COLOR;\n"
"\tfloat lum = dot(c.rgb, vec3(0.3, 0.59, 0.11));\n"
"\tvec3 t = texture(fill, floor(FRAGCOORD.xy / px) / 64.0).rgb;\n"
"\tfloat k = smoothstep(0.22, 0.42, lum);\n"
"\tc.rgb = mix(c.rgb, c.rgb * t * 1.85, k * 0.9);\n"
"\tCOLOR = c;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"shader_type canvas_item;\n"
"uniform sampler2D fill : filter_nearest, repeat_enable;\n"
"uniform float px = 4.0;\n"
"void fragment() {\n"
"\tvec4 c = texture(TEXTURE, UV) * COLOR;\n"
"\tfloat lum = dot(c.rgb, vec3(0.3, 0.59, 0.11));\n"
"\tvec3 t = texture(fill, floor(FRAGCOORD.xy / px) / 64.0).rgb;\n"
"\tfloat k = smoothstep(0.22, 0.42, lum);\n"
"\tc.rgb = mix(c.rgb, c.rgb * t * 1.85, k * 0.9);\n"
"\tCOLOR = c;\n"
"}\n"

